// Lint waivers used by make -C hw/sim lint (run.sh).
// A module that uses arcade_regs_pkg needs only a few of its constants; the rest would be
// reported as UNUSEDPARAM under -Wall. The package is frozen (AGENTS.md section 6, R-6.1),
// so the waiver lives here and is scoped to that one file. Refs #30.
`verilator_config
lint_off -rule UNUSEDPARAM -file "*/hw/rtl/arcade_regs_pkg.sv"
